<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak Jan jobless rate rises to 13.59 pct (12.84).</title>
<headline>Slovak Jan jobless rate rises to 13.59 pct (12.84).</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of jobless in Slovakia in January totalled 353,605 persons, or 13.59 percent of the workforce, up from 12.84 percent in December, the National Labour Office said on Monday.</p>
<p> SLOVAK UNEMPLOYMENT	 JAN 1997   DEC 1996   JAN 1996</p>
<p>  Total jobless		 353,605    329,749    387,086</p>
<p>  Percentage of workforce    13.59	12.84	13.73</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 42-7-563-3687</p>
</text>
